WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:04.710
Switch the theme on this page and even the
caption changes color.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:09.110
Which components actually read the theme, and
which render when it changes?

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:12.870
Context readers shows who reads the value
from one provider.

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:15.510
A render recording answers the second
question.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:18.550
With the heading selected, open Context
readers.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:23.150
Three components read this provider,
including the toast rendered in a portal.

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:26.750
With render measurement enabled, choose
Record renders.

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:29.470
Switch the theme once, then stop recording.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:32.790
The heading, badge, and toast each rendered
once.

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:38.550
Under Not readers, the caption recorded zero
renders. Its color came from CSS.
